      ],
      "source": "https://www.city-guide-stockholm.com/en/tourism/discover-stockholm/neighborhood-by-neighborhood/vasastan.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Vasastan boasts four major parks: Vasaparken, Observatorielunden, Vanadislunden, and Bellevueparken.",
